  WrittenDialogue: "Okay I think I get the gist of this Christianity thing.\nThat’s great to hear, Kelly. Do you unconditionally accept Christ within your heart?\nUnconditionally? That sounds like the start of an abusive relationship.\nI feel like if you’d fall that deep you people might fall for anything.\nLemme think about this..."
